OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1985FThe Nine o'Clock News (BBC One)
OL,7,Fis relaunched, with a new title
OL,8,Fsequence and set.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThe theme tune is composed by George
OL,11,FFenton. The programme now has two
OL,12,Fpresenters each night. On launch night,
OL,13,FJohn Humphrys and Julia Somerville
OL,14,Fpresent.
OL,15,
OL,16,FPatrick Lunt - BBC Radio 2
OL,17,Fannouncer/news presenter - provides the
OL,18,Fpresenter namecheck over the opening
OL,19,Ftitles.
